{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1083950-post-hypnotic-sugestion","id":1083950,"title":"Post Hypnotic Sugestion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-26T07:00:05-07:00","id":1083950,"title":"Post Hypnotic Sugestion","content":"This came up recently and I can honestly say I wasn't sure. I know Mind 4 for subconscious mind control. And if you want to delay the effect it's Time 4 with Entropy 2 for a conditional trigger. But what about a triggered mental effect throuh suggestion? Could Mind 3 alone do this. Technically wouldn't the effect be taking place at the moment of casting and be tied to its triggering situation as part of the suggestion? <br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T08:18:03-07:00","id":1083982,"title":"","content":"** Inserting 2 cents **<br /> <br /> Personally, I think Mind 3 alone could do this, without the Time 4, Entropy 2 trigger, but with three separate problems of its own.<br /> <br /> 1) You would need enough successes for duration to last long enough for the suggestion to trigger.<br /> 2) The suggestion is detectable (and thus removable) while it is dormant.<br /> 3) The suggestion could trigger incorrectly (wrong stimuli, bad interpretation, etc.).<br /> <br /> The notion is the effect is itself is constantly present, but only reacts to a vague list of conditions, much like someone who is deathly afraid of water is normally calm, sitting a chair, reading a book. The fear is still there, as part of their psyche, but does not react until stimuli presents a large body of water (real or imagined).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12655-tzizimine","name":"tzizimine","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T00:29:20-07:00","id":1084367,"title":"","content":"Mind 3 plus hanging to make an Effect that doesn't activate until the appropriate moment, Mind 4 if you just want to implant the command and be forget it. At least, how I see it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T05:26:26-07:00","id":1084421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1083950-post-hypnotic-sugestion?p=1084367#post1084367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mind 3 plus hanging to make an Effect that doesn't activate until the appropriate moment, Mind 4 if you just want to implant the command and be forget it. At least, how I see it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ya, that was the way I was leaning when it came up, but then wasn't really sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T07:08:57-07:00","id":1084467,"title":"","content":"The classic Technocratic Conditioning operates with Mind and Prime alone. Near as I can tell, the Prime 2 element is to make a Mind manipulation &quot;self-sustaining&quot;, and the Conditioning itself is just a Mind 3/4 effect to influence or control behavior, insert triggers, or alter/edit memories. To mirror that, though, you'd need something to anchor the influence to - in the case of Conditioning, it's like a lingering Mind influence that says &quot;obey your superiors in the Union&quot;, but you could also set up &quot;If someone presents you with this sigil, listen to their instructions&quot; or something similar.<br /> <br /> This approach wouldn't quite allow the &quot;Do this when X happens&quot; model, though, as you or an ally would need to be present to issue commands when the time comes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i> I attack people with giant insects both </i>on <i>and </i>off <i>the court.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1653-five-eyes","name":"Five Eyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"395"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}